Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.72,0:00:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Un e-mail de la un expeditor necunoscut...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.03,0:00:09.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oare aș putea afla de unde \Na venit Nadeshiko dacă aș merge?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai venit!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun-venit la întâlnirea deținătorilor!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.88,0:00:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.59,0:00:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pare o adunare complet normală!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.91,0:00:36.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci a ta este fată, nu, Miaka?{sgt: the anime doesn't even get a moment to explain where "Miaka" even comes from.}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? D-Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.85,0:00:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și a mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.06,0:00:44.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uite ce drăguță este în această poză.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.88,0:00:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum este a ta, Miaka?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.07,0:00:52.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, numele ei este Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.52,0:00:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar e un robot?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.67,0:00:59.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Corpul ei nu pare să \Naibă părți mecanice.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.02,0:00:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De parcă...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.49,0:01:00.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miaka!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.52,0:01:02.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.84,0:01:06.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko e complet adorabilă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pare că ar putea începe \Nsă vorbească în orice clipă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:08.71,0:01:12.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, dar majoritatea modelelor \Nnu sunt grozave la conversare.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.10,0:01:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stai, asta înseamnă că Nadeshiko
Dialogue: 99,0:01:18.62,0:01:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nu e deloc un android obișnuit!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu am aflat absolut nimic!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.33,0:01:31.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și cel mai rău lucru dintre toate,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:32.23,0:01:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}se pare că eu eram singurul pervers care a făcut sex cu androidul său.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.28,0:01:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speram să aflu mai multe \Nlucruri despre Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.10,0:01:45.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ți-aș putea spune tot felul \Nde lucruri dacă dorești.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.86,0:01:48.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spre exemplu...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.97,0:01:50.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...despre corpul tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.98,0:01:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.39,0:01:56.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce se petrece? \NDe ce sunt două?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.72,0:02:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E cumva un robot-ninja și eu nu știam?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.54,0:02:02.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Akane...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.19,0:02:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te iubesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.23,0:02:09.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu știu de ce,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.44,0:02:13.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}dar e așa de plăcut când \Nîmi șoptește la ureche.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.03,0:02:17.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spuneai că vrei să știi mai multe despre mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.18,0:02:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci m-am gândit să-ți arăt câteva capabilități \Nde realitate virtuală pe care nu ți le prezentasem.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.53,0:02:24.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cea în rochie neagră e o proiecție?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exact.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.40,0:02:30.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acțiunile de lingere
Dialogue: 99,0:02:31.21,0:02:33.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,și sugere
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sunt replicate aproape perfect.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.96,0:02:42.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vezi? Eu nu te ating deloc.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.18,0:02:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nu sunt mulțumită doar să privesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.17,0:02:47.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai! Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:49.65,0:02:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aceleași trucuri din nou!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.83,0:02:59.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.10,0:03:04.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum erau ceilalți androizi?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, am câteva poze. \NVrei să le vezi?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.63,0:03:08.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, te rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Această poză...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.30,0:03:21.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă întreb dacă mi-a \Nvăzut mesajul ascuns.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.22,0:03:25.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am mai văzut-o pe \NNadeshiko de ceva timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.79,0:03:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Abia aștept.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.23,0:00:04.11,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Dorim să vă invităm la o întâlnire online, \Nanonimă a deținătorilor de roboți de dragoste.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:05.69,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,În ziua evenimentului, vă rugăm să folosiți linkul de mai jos pentru a participa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:11.32,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Participă
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:37.41,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Our doll hobby escalated into \Na humanoid robot obsession.
